# vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/model_call_budget.py

`ModelCallBudget`, a deepagents middleware that caps the number of model calls in one session. The last permitted call keeps only the outcome (verdict) tools and appends a "FINAL TURN" notice. A caller that opts in (`raise_when_exhausted`) gets error VVAH-E007 when the session still calls the model after that forced final turn.

Source: `vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/model_call_budget.py` (lines 1-117)
Executor: code
